WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.421
Discuss rainfall, flooding and safer waste disposal

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:08.952
Weather: the condition of the atmosphere at a particular time. Rainfall: water that

00:00:08.952 --> 00:00:10.747
falls from clouds as rain.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:15.946
Pollution: harmful waste or substances in our surroundings. Sanitation: keeping

00:00:15.946 --> 00:00:21.573
places clean to protect health. Climate: the usual pattern of weather over many

00:00:21.573 --> 00:00:22.006
years.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:26.877
Keep a five-day weather record and suggest one community improvement.
